    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Frequency count</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/ransom-note/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 383</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Ransom Note</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The note can be built when the magazine holds at least as many copies of every letter as the note needs. Fill a 26-slot stock from the magazine, spend one slot per note letter, and fail the moment a slot goes negative. O(m + n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
